This distribution adapts the personal Content Hub appearance stylesheet into a
portable FreshRSS user extension. Standalone reader, configuration, four-stream
navigation, localization and interaction code were prepared on 2026-10-20.

Youlag by civilblur (https://github.com/civilblur/youlag) inspired the focused
video and article-reading approach. Youlag's source/minified bundle is not
redistributed here. Its project is licensed under GPLv3; consult upstream for
its own notices. Compatibility CSS selector names do not bundle its assets.

FreshRSS is a separate project: https://github.com/FreshRSS/FreshRSS
No FreshRSS installation, dependency, watch artwork, trademark logo or licensed
font is included. Watch-inspired theme names imply no manufacturer affiliation.
